(7466725, 1185070, 63218, '<td valign="top">What it is about this that makes it so captivating I don''t know. But it is. Ever thing about it, from the funny little trees (trees? on a sandy beach?) to the rock pile, to the black dog, to the handspring is ... captivating. Part of the charm has to be the PP. You took a good picture &amp; you treated it well. Good work &amp; thanks.</td>', 'What it is about this that makes it so captivating I don''t know. But it is. Ever thing about it, from the funny little trees (trees? on a sandy beach?) to the rock pile, to the black dog, to the handspring is ... captivating. Part of the charm has to be the PP. You took a good picture & you treated it well. Good work & thanks.', '2016-08-02 09:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7466727, 1184816, 63218, '<td valign="top">I can only admire your ability to get 12 people to do the same thing at the same time, with sunlight on their faces (except for basement guy)--not to mention thinking up the idea in the first place. This is so much fun, like a little advent calendar. Thanks.</td>', 'I can only admire your ability to get 12 people to do the same thing at the same time, with sunlight on their faces (except for basement guy)--not to mention thinking up the idea in the first place. This is so much fun, like a little advent calendar. Thanks.', '2016-08-02 10:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7466728, 1185064, 63218, '<td valign="top">Luck &amp; skill in the same shot--nicely done.</td>', 'Luck & skill in the same shot--nicely done.', '2016-08-02 10:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7466729, 1185203, 63218, '<td valign="top">The warm BW tones give him a cuddly appeal that makes a nice contrast to his intimidating  presence. Good work.</td>', 'The warm BW tones give him a cuddly appeal that makes a nice contrast to his intimidating  presence. Good work.', '2016-08-02 10:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
