(7466735, 1184415, 63218, '<td valign="top">Really good shot--you must be so pleased. I never can find their eyes--I can''t imagine how the world looks to them. Thanks.</td>', 'Really good shot--you must be so pleased. I never can find their eyes--I can''t imagine how the world looks to them. Thanks.', '2016-08-02 10:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
