(7466741, 1184925, 63218, '<td valign="top">The antenna makes the sky look like a painted backdrop. Lots of good detail in this, it''s fun to scroll around &amp; imagine re-framing it to get another take on this nice old car. Somehow you made it look clean &amp; shiny.</td>', 'The antenna makes the sky look like a painted backdrop. Lots of good detail in this, it''s fun to scroll around & imagine re-framing it to get another take on this nice old car. Somehow you made it look clean & shiny.', '2016-08-02 10:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
