(7467783, 1185152, 97774, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Donna-Dee:</b></div><hr/><i> This looks like Vermillion Lake! Awesome! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It is at the Vermilion Lakes. This shot is from the second Lake. This location is only a five minute drive from my home, you managed to get some great photos on your recent trip here! I hoping you enjoyed the Canadian Rockies.</td>', 'Originally posted by Donna-Dee: This looks like Vermillion Lake! Awesome!   It is at the Vermilion Lakes. This shot is from the second Lake. This location is only a five minute drive from my home, you managed to get some great photos on your recent trip here! I hoping you enjoyed the Canadian Rockies.', '2016-08-08 19:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
